<title>CANADA: Loblaw Cos Ltd Q4 shr net rises.</title>
<headline>Loblaw Cos Ltd Q4 shr net rises.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.25		   C$0.20</p>
<p> Net			 59,900		   49,300</p>
<p> Revs		   2,380,000		2,224,000</p>
<p>	   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.72		   C$0.60</p>
<p> Net			173,700		  146,700</p>
<p> Revs		   9,847,500		9,853,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Results for 1995 included a pre-tax gain of C$4.8 million for the sale in the second quarter of substantially all of the assets of the U.S. retail business.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
